ARTICLE 18 - UNIFIED PENALTY SCHEDULE
18.1 The same penalty schedule applies to Articles 12 and 19 and to
Level-4 IRA enforcement.
18.2 Tier 1 - first minor breach:
   reprimand + mandatory retraining.

18.3 Tier 2 - material or repeated breach:
   withholding of up to 5 percent of the specific AI operations budget
   line.

18.4 Tier 3 - knowing breach or repeat breach within twenty-four months:
   withholding of up to 10 percent of the specific AI operations budget
   line, plus suspension or removal of the responsible official where
   authorized by law.

18.5 The aggregate statutory withholding cap is 10 percent of the relevant
AI operations line.
18.6 No sanction may reduce statutory public services.
18.7 Safety-critical operations are exempt from operational withholding;
the sanction applies instead to the agency's discretionary AI budget.
18.8 Liability shall be calibrated to:
   (a) severity of harm;
   (b) knowledge;
   (c) repetition;
   (d) degree of control;
   (e) causal contribution.

