ARTICLE 20 - HAZARD-CLASS TEMPLATES
20.1 The IRA shall maintain pre-registered templates for each presumptive
hazard class.
20.2 Each template specifies:
   (a) indicators;
   (b) baseline metrics;
   (c) failure thresholds;
   (d) minimum data-collection frequency;
   (e) uncertainty requirements.

20.3 An unforeseen emergency that does not match an existing template
requires an ad hoc indicator set.
20.4 The ad hoc indicator set shall be lodged simultaneously with the
emergency declaration.
20.5 Ad hoc indicators shall be audited ex post using the same methodological
standard applicable to pre-registered templates.
