ARTICLE 39 - IRA ENFORCEMENT
39.1 LEVEL 1 - ADMINISTRATIVE WARNING
 Mandatory cure within seven days.

39.2 LEVEL 2 - COMPULSORY STAY
 Immediate suspension of option generation and consequential execution.

39.3 LEVEL 3 - REGULATOR STOP
 L2 stop executed through safe state or degraded mode, together with
 applicable registry restrictions.

39.4 LEVEL 4 - FINANCIAL AND INDIVIDUAL
 Application of Article 18 and referral for applicable disciplinary
 proceedings.

39.5 No enforcement level authorizes the IRA to operate the regulated system.
