ARTICLE 40 - FINANCIAL AUTONOMY AND OVERSIGHT
40.1 The IRA shall receive non-discretionary statutory funding.
40.2 The funding mechanism may include a statutory levy on public-sector
IT/AI procurement, subject to constitutional and budgetary law.
40.3 Funding shall not be conditioned on annual administrative approval in a
