ARTICLE 45 - HIERARCHY AND INTERACTION
45.1 Constitutional emergency powers remain in force unless displaced by
higher constitutional law.
45.2 Article 19 governs AI-assisted decisions conducted within a valid
constitutional emergency regime to the extent permitted by
