46.4 The Registry is not merely a database. It is a legal provenance layer
connecting decisions, authorities, evidence, models, and procedural
states.
46.5 Hosting jurisdiction shall not itself constitute algorithmic sovereignty.
46.6 Interface control shall not itself constitute algorithmic sovereignty.
