   (c) challenge outcomes;
   (d) certificate decisions;
   (e) emergency declarations;
   (f) stop events;
   (g) drill results;
   (h) provenance failures;
   (i) metric values;
   (j) recalibration status.

55.3 Anonymized audit records shall be released as open data where lawful.
