56.1 The following are structural invariants of this Title:
   I1  Human authorship of the legally operative initial framing.

   I2  Citizen priority-setting cannot substitute for legal framing.

   I3  Consequential AI execution requires prior authorization.

   I4  Emergency authority is hazard-linked and time-limited.

   I5  Emergency authority cannot silently become permanent authority.

   I6  No administrative actor may unilaterally operate the regulatory
