   I10 Emergency outputs do not automatically become unrestricted
       training data.

   I11 The regulator remains subject to audit and judicial review.

   I12 Metric recalibration cannot silently become substantive legislation.

   I13 Anti-fragmentation applies to form as well as substance.

   I14 Good-faith reliance is protected subject to judicially controlled
       remedies.

   I15 No single procedural layer constitutes the entire governance
       architecture.

   I16 Degraded mode is mathematically bounded, not semantically
       discretionary.

   I17 Metric rejection rates are severity-weighted to prevent
