ARTICLE 58 - FORMAL LTL INVARIANTS
58.1 The Layered Law of Stop and restart authorities shall satisfy
   the following Linear Temporal Logic (LTL) safety properties:
   (a) G ( (L1_stop ∨ L2_stop ∨ L3_stop ∨ L4_stop) →
           X[0..24h] (RegistryResolution ∨ SystemSafeState) )
   (b) G ( SystemSafeState → ¬(ConsequentialExecution) )
